ound-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">start</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">reactive</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  input</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">$</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">daterange</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">[</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">]</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">end</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">reactive</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  input</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">$</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">daterange</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">[</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">]</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLine1Temp </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> sqlQuery</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Conx</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;SELECT time, value\r\n                     FROM picomp\r\n                     WHERE tag = &#39;A80100&#39;\r\n                      AND time &gt;= DATE(begin)\r\n                      AND time &lt;= DATE(finish)\r\n                     where begin=toupper(start())\r\n                     where finish=toupper(end()&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nshinyServer</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">function</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">input</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> output</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">{</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  output</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">$</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">temp </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> plot</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Line1Temp</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><br></span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">UI.R</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">library</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">shiny</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nlibrary</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">googleVis</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nlibrary</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">reshape</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nshinyUI</span><span style=\"background-color:tr